(6886522, 1037995, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely Decor and great makeup. I look at this and think Poison Ivy from the Batman comic and movies... Camera work is not bad. I think you need a faster shutter speed as there is definitely some motion blur along with a bit of over exposure. I think the green goes well with the gold tones of your hair.</td>', 'Lovely Decor and great makeup. I look at this and think Poison Ivy from the Batman comic and movies... Camera work is not bad. I think you need a faster shutter speed as there is definitely some motion blur along with a bit of over exposure. I think the green goes well with the gold tones of your hair.', '2012-10-19 21:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886524, 1037862, 59737, '<td valign="top">Was expecting to see a few of this type of picture, nice sharp focus and good exposure.  I like the foreground leaves, it adds dimension and depth for me on this.</td>', 'Was expecting to see a few of this type of picture, nice sharp focus and good exposure.  I like the foreground leaves, it adds dimension and depth for me on this.', '2012-10-19 21:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
