(6886527, 1037731, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shadow, like the negative space in this one, good catch lights in your eyes and a good expression, goes along with the title well.</td>', 'Good use of light and shadow, like the negative space in this one, good catch lights in your eyes and a good expression, goes along with the title well.', '2012-10-19 21:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886533, 1037751, 59737, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t make out the book in the thumb but title makes more sense when I see the full size.  A tighter crop would have looked better for my taste and the sweatshirt on the right of the frame looks a little out of place.  I''m curious what it would have looked like if you had a little more light on your face like if you had a phone or other small light held in the book.  Focus and DoF look good.</td>', 'Couldn''t make out the book in the thumb but title makes more sense when I see the full size.  A tighter crop would have looked better for my taste and the sweatshirt on the right of the frame looks a little out of place.  I''m curious what it would have looked like if you had a little more light on your face like if you had a phone or other small light held in the book.  Focus and DoF look good.', '2012-10-19 21:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886535, 1037799, 59737, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred this if you would have had your eye open, the closed eye doesn''t give me anything to connect to.</td>', 'Would have preferred this if you would have had your eye open, the closed eye doesn''t give me anything to connect to.', '2012-10-19 21:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
