(6886548, 1037921, 59737, '<td valign="top">NIce, lots of details to look at with all the figures reflected in the glass along with you, other nice details like the cigar hold my interest.  I like the color pallet on this.</td>', 'NIce, lots of details to look at with all the figures reflected in the glass along with you, other nice details like the cigar hold my interest.  I like the color pallet on this.', '2012-10-19 21:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886552, 1037255, 59737, '<td valign="top">I don''t know about this being a secret portrait but it''s a good portrait, really nice light on your face, great colors on the wrap around your head.  Very painterly type image, could see this being painted on a canvas.</td>', 'I don''t know about this being a secret portrait but it''s a good portrait, really nice light on your face, great colors on the wrap around your head.  Very painterly type image, could see this being painted on a canvas.', '2012-10-19 21:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886555, 1037877, 59737, '<td valign="top">Mysterious, there''s a bit too much space above you for my tastes and I''d like to see you placed further to the right in the frame.  I like the high key look on this and the ability to just make out the details of your face.</td>', 'Mysterious, there''s a bit too much space above you for my tastes and I''d like to see you placed further to the right in the frame.  I like the high key look on this and the ability to just make out the details of your face.', '2012-10-19 21:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
