(6886560, 1037971, 59737, '<td valign="top">strange point of view, you''re not really the focus of the image with the couple in the background being in sharp focus, the focus then causes some distraction for me.</td>', 'strange point of view, you''re not really the focus of the image with the couple in the background being in sharp focus, the focus then causes some distraction for me.', '2012-10-19 21:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886562, 1037942, 59737, '<td valign="top">Cool image, interesting scene and location, your being in a nice dress seems out of place in the setting which adds tension for me and lends itself to telling a story (what are you doing there?  why are you dressed up?).  The added motion of your head adds that mystery and obviously obscures you features and identity.</td>', 'Cool image, interesting scene and location, your being in a nice dress seems out of place in the setting which adds tension for me and lends itself to telling a story (what are you doing there?  why are you dressed up?).  The added motion of your head adds that mystery and obviously obscures you features and identity.', '2012-10-19 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886565, 1037955, 59737, '<td valign="top">curious picture, looks like a cat costume and a reflection of some sort.  The stairway and bannister in the background add to this for me but overall I think there''s too much space that isn''t being effectively used in the picture.</td>', 'curious picture, looks like a cat costume and a reflection of some sort.  The stairway and bannister in the background add to this for me but overall I think there''s too much space that isn''t being effectively used in the picture.', '2012-10-19 21:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886566, 1037789, 59737, '<td valign="top">Interesting and strong image especially with the title.  Somewhat disturbing and dark but I like the overall impact it''s got, the strong vertical light in the background really gives this tension and adds to the mood.</td>', 'Interesting and strong image especially with the title.  Somewhat disturbing and dark but I like the overall impact it''s got, the strong vertical light in the background really gives this tension and adds to the mood.', '2012-10-19 21:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886568, 1037996, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice golden tones, not a bad image and the framing works but there''s not a whole lot to hold my attention here, since it''s a shadow there''s really no chance of making out details of your face and the ability to make out those details would add something for me and keep me looking longer.  The water drops are a nice touch to give some texture to what could be a totally flat image.</td>', 'Nice golden tones, not a bad image and the framing works but there''s not a whole lot to hold my attention here, since it''s a shadow there''s really no chance of making out details of your face and the ability to make out those details would add something for me and keep me looking longer.  The water drops are a nice touch to give some texture to what could be a totally flat image.', '2012-10-19 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886569, 1037734, 59737, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and good sharp focus on your face behind the lights.  I think this might have worked better for me if the lights had gone edge to edge rather than just being centered or a longer exposure and a little movement in the lights might have also been interesting.  This just seem a little static for me.</td>', 'Interesting concept and good sharp focus on your face behind the lights.  I think this might have worked better for me if the lights had gone edge to edge rather than just being centered or a longer exposure and a little movement in the lights might have also been interesting.  This just seem a little static for me.', '2012-10-19 22:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886570, 1037771, 59737, '<td valign="top">I almost went with something like this, really well executed, I like your choice of standing against a wall and letting the wall fall away with the DoF.  You''ve also capture the texture of the wood well, this is nice.</td>', 'I almost went with something like this, really well executed, I like your choice of standing against a wall and letting the wall fall away with the DoF.  You''ve also capture the texture of the wood well, this is nice.', '2012-10-19 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886574, 1037930, 59737, '<td valign="top">Different, you''ve got to be a good paddler, have a good remote or a partner to have gotten this image, you''ve probably gotten this comment already but this would have worked better for me if you were paddling into the frame rather than crowding yourself with no place to go in the upper left.  Nice colors and reflection in the water.</td>', 'Different, you''ve got to be a good paddler, have a good remote or a partner to have gotten this image, you''ve probably gotten this comment already but this would have worked better for me if you were paddling into the frame rather than crowding yourself with no place to go in the upper left.  Nice colors and reflection in the water.', '2012-10-19 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886576, 1037956, 59737, '<td valign="top">Awesome, great idea well executed, great details with the stars coming through and the contre jour lighting with your shadow breaking it all up.</td>', 'Awesome, great idea well executed, great details with the stars coming through and the contre jour lighting with your shadow breaking it all up.', '2012-10-19 22:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886580, 1037976, 59737, '<td valign="top">funny like the title, love the reflection of the trees in the shoehorn, looks like a painting, great imagination to think of this in my opinion.</td>', 'funny like the title, love the reflection of the trees in the shoehorn, looks like a painting, great imagination to think of this in my opinion.', '2012-10-19 22:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886581, 1037925, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good use of reflection here, assuming this is a poster for a show, you probably took this shot both with your reflection and the poster in focus and chose the one you liked best but I''m curious to see the picture with you in focus and exposed for.  Like the square crop on this.</td>', 'Good use of reflection here, assuming this is a poster for a show, you probably took this shot both with your reflection and the poster in focus and chose the one you liked best but I''m curious to see the picture with you in focus and exposed for.  Like the square crop on this.', '2012-10-19 22:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886583, 1037959, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice, think this would have looked nice with a softer focus would have given it a romantic feeling that would have worked well with the veil, couldn''t go too crazy in basic editing but the sharpness doesn''t work that well for me.  White balance also looks a little bit off on my monitor, a little too yellow/orange.</td>', 'Nice, think this would have looked nice with a softer focus would have given it a romantic feeling that would have worked well with the veil, couldn''t go too crazy in basic editing but the sharpness doesn''t work that well for me.  White balance also looks a little bit off on my monitor, a little too yellow/orange.', '2012-10-19 22:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886587, 1037968, 59737, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack the secret portion of the challenge and the image looks soft with neither you nor your reflection sharp.  Soft focus can work but don''t think it does with this image.  Your expression is pretty neutral which doesn''t lend itself well to the title  There''s also some dust on the mirror which distracts me from the overall effect.</td>', 'Seems to lack the secret portion of the challenge and the image looks soft with neither you nor your reflection sharp.  Soft focus can work but don''t think it does with this image.  Your expression is pretty neutral which doesn''t lend itself well to the title  There''s also some dust on the mirror which distracts me from the overall effect.', '2012-10-19 22:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886589, 1037965, 59737, '<td valign="top">Funny and clever, the spray of water does a good job of hiding your features and the random droplets add some interest but overall there''s not a lot to hold my interest.</td>', 'Funny and clever, the spray of water does a good job of hiding your features and the random droplets add some interest but overall there''s not a lot to hold my interest.', '2012-10-19 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6886590, 1037944, 59737, '<td valign="top">cool and mysterious, like this a lot, it''s got a Mother Nature or wood nymph feel to it, the leaf adds a nice touch to this.</td>', 'cool and mysterious, like this a lot, it''s got a Mother Nature or wood nymph feel to it, the leaf adds a nice touch to this.', '2012-10-19 22:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
