(6886788, 1037988, 59029, '<td valign="top">pretty good drag, though your face looks far too smooth.  Some stubble along the jawline would have added texture. The pov also accentuates the femininity of your face, shooting level or even up would have helped.<br/> <br/>ETA: just for fun...<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=483084" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/647/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_483084.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/647/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_483084.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/647/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_483084.jpg"/></a>...a little stubble and work on the body language can go a long way!! :-)  PS Sorry, I missed a number before, I just saw the thumb was completely not the one I meant to post.</td>', 'pretty good drag, though your face looks far too smooth.  Some stubble along the jawline would have added texture. The pov also accentuates the femininity of your face, shooting level or even up would have helped. ETA: just for fun......a little stubble and work on the body language can go a long way!! :-)  PS Sorry, I missed a number before, I just saw the thumb was completely not the one I meant to post.', '2012-10-20 11:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
