(6888929, 1037255, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Love the intensity of the eyes, and the color of the robe. Lighting is just right.</td>', 'Excellent. Love the intensity of the eyes, and the color of the robe. Lighting is just right.', '2012-10-23 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888931, 1037968, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure what, but this doesn''t say confrontation to me - more sadness, contemplation, resignation... Excellent lighting and composition.</td>', 'Not sure what, but this doesn''t say confrontation to me - more sadness, contemplation, resignation... Excellent lighting and composition.', '2012-10-23 12:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888933, 1037483, 77196, '<td valign="top">Freaky. This would make a great shot to use in a horror flick - like, "What is that?" Moves closer, and then figures it out. "I''m outta here!"<br/>Great use of lighting to have something very familiar appear as something unrecognizable.</td>', 'Freaky. This would make a great shot to use in a horror flick - like, "What is that?" Moves closer, and then figures it out. "I''m outta here!"Great use of lighting to have something very familiar appear as something unrecognizable.', '2012-10-23 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888936, 1037986, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the masking, and the slight motion blur. There is an excellent juxtaposition of the mystery of the mask, and the clearly stated (visible, well-lit) eyes.</td>', 'I like the masking, and the slight motion blur. There is an excellent juxtaposition of the mystery of the mask, and the clearly stated (visible, well-lit) eyes.', '2012-10-23 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888937, 1037976, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure that does you any favors... ;-p Cute idea, well executed. Are you sure you didn''t intend this for the Reflections without Mirrors challenge?</td>', 'Not sure that does you any favors... ;-p Cute idea, well executed. Are you sure you didn''t intend this for the Reflections without Mirrors challenge?', '2012-10-23 13:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888938, 1037611, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! That works as a great disguise. Looks like you put in a non-trivial amount of work on the crest at the forehead and design of the mask.</td>', 'Wow! That works as a great disguise. Looks like you put in a non-trivial amount of work on the crest at the forehead and design of the mask.', '2012-10-23 13:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888939, 1037812, 77196, '<td valign="top">I don''t even want to know how many shots it took you to get this. Excellent placement of magazine. Very nice lighting.</td>', 'I don''t even want to know how many shots it took you to get this. Excellent placement of magazine. Very nice lighting.', '2012-10-23 13:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888940, 1037944, 77196, '<td valign="top">Scary subtle.</td>', 'Scary subtle.', '2012-10-23 13:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888945, 1037995, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting. Interesting expression and use of make-up and color.</td>', 'Very harsh lighting. Interesting expression and use of make-up and color.', '2012-10-23 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888947, 1037921, 77196, '<td valign="top">Are you smoking that cigar with your ear?</td>', 'Are you smoking that cigar with your ear?', '2012-10-23 13:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888951, 1037930, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines and colors in the water. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Interesting lines and colors in the water. Nice lighting.', '2012-10-23 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888958, 1037955, 77196, '<td valign="top">Light from left side a bit too harsh. The white in the stair railing and hat/head pet helps tone it down some, but not quite enough. Very pleasing overall.</td>', 'Light from left side a bit too harsh. The white in the stair railing and hat/head pet helps tone it down some, but not quite enough. Very pleasing overall.', '2012-10-23 13:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888960, 1037865, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Interesting angle.</td>', 'Cute. Interesting angle.', '2012-10-23 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888963, 1037620, 77196, '<td valign="top">Mr. Wilson! (obscure reference to the Home Improvement US TV show from years ago). Very creative way to distort your face enough to not be recognized. Nice hat, too.</td>', 'Mr. Wilson! (obscure reference to the Home Improvement US TV show from years ago). Very creative way to distort your face enough to not be recognized. Nice hat, too.', '2012-10-23 13:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888964, 1037950, 77196, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective setup. Not even enough to tell male / female. The red glasses add a nice splash of color.</td>', 'Simple, effective setup. Not even enough to tell male / female. The red glasses add a nice splash of color.', '2012-10-23 13:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888968, 1037959, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Very pretty veil / head scarf / detail work on veil.</td>', 'Beautiful. Very pretty veil / head scarf / detail work on veil.', '2012-10-23 13:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888973, 1037771, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''d know that nose anywhere. Um... not really. Nice use of hood to hide eyes &amp; most of face shape. Not sure if I like the background on the right side of shot.</td>', 'I''d know that nose anywhere. Um... not really. Nice use of hood to hide eyes & most of face shape. Not sure if I like the background on the right side of shot.', '2012-10-23 13:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6888976, 1037751, 77196, '<td valign="top">Bit too dark on the face</td>', 'Bit too dark on the face', '2012-10-23 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889008, 1037821, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hmm, stands out from the crowd, a little (false) machismo, Simms springs to mind!  That said, the photo doesn''t have his delicate touch.  If you are going to break from the expected, it has to be done really well, and while this is a good photo, it isn''t a really good photo.</td>', 'Hmm, stands out from the crowd, a little (false) machismo, Simms springs to mind!  That said, the photo doesn''t have his delicate touch.  If you are going to break from the expected, it has to be done really well, and while this is a good photo, it isn''t a really good photo.', '2012-10-23 13:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889020, 1037255, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well, you are recognisable, Marac, but it is a cracking photo.  Not dinging you for the unrecognisable part - a self-portrait in a different guise is good enough for me.<br/> <br/>Edit, back to bump and just noticed the initials of your title - nice touch.</td>', 'Well, you are recognisable, Marac, but it is a cracking photo.  Not dinging you for the unrecognisable part - a self-portrait in a different guise is good enough for me. Edit, back to bump and just noticed the initials of your title - nice touch.', '2012-10-23 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6889021, 1037934, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, Bear!  You can never hide from us, you know!</td>', 'Ha, Bear!  You can never hide from us, you know!', '2012-10-23 14:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
