(6890202, 1037991, 47316, '<td valign="top">Scooter? :D Lovely, moody lighting. I like the flow of the sheet. I think having it go up at an angle more in the corner to fill some negative space may have made it that much better. Something just seems missing that''s keeping it from being a good shot to a killer shot.</td>', 'Scooter? :D Lovely, moody lighting. I like the flow of the sheet. I think having it go up at an angle more in the corner to fill some negative space may have made it that much better. Something just seems missing that''s keeping it from being a good shot to a killer shot.', '2012-10-24 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
