(6891726, 1037949, 43463, '<td valign="top">Very artsy in that it very effectively captures the look and feel of sadness. What makes the imagery so potent is that many of us can connect with the emotion of sadness at one time or another in our lives and that is why it resonated very well. The blue hue tones of processing support and complement the overall feel of sadness - great details with the single eye and the clarity of drops of water. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Very artsy in that it very effectively captures the look and feel of sadness. What makes the imagery so potent is that many of us can connect with the emotion of sadness at one time or another in our lives and that is why it resonated very well. The blue hue tones of processing support and complement the overall feel of sadness - great details with the single eye and the clarity of drops of water. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2012-10-26 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6891738, 1037611, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the wordplay on injecting your name into the title, Cory:-) Lighting and the details are just fabulous! That single, piercing blue eye peers out of the camouflage and ensnare''s the audience''s attention. This Boehican obviously went hunting voters and succeeded;-) <br/> <br/>Question: You mentioned that you got chemical burns. Did you use Spirit Gum? It''s what we used in Theatre years ago to afix beards, fake noses, elf ears and the like.</td>', 'Love the wordplay on injecting your name into the title, Cory:-) Lighting and the details are just fabulous! That single, piercing blue eye peers out of the camouflage and ensnare''s the audience''s attention. This Boehican obviously went hunting voters and succeeded;-)  Question: You mentioned that you got chemical burns. Did you use Spirit Gum? It''s what we used in Theatre years ago to afix beards, fake noses, elf ears and the like.', '2012-10-26 11:59:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6891747, 1037770, 43463, '<td valign="top">Oh....my....ROFLMAO! I am floored with what you did to achieve the creepy and ''ugly'' guy. Love, love the humor of the shot and kudos to you for your creativity. Great pose with the sly look and the ''stick'' in the mouth as that he definately seems to be posing to look ''sexy'' for the ladies on Match.com. The lighting is also great for it further accents the facial features, wrinkles and veins in the face and hands. Grats on placing in the top 5!</td>', 'Oh....my....ROFLMAO! I am floored with what you did to achieve the creepy and ''ugly'' guy. Love, love the humor of the shot and kudos to you for your creativity. Great pose with the sly look and the ''stick'' in the mouth as that he definately seems to be posing to look ''sexy'' for the ladies on Match.com. The lighting is also great for it further accents the facial features, wrinkles and veins in the face and hands. Grats on placing in the top 5!', '2012-10-26 12:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
